# 🔐 6. Security in VPC Peering

---

## 🔹 No transitive routing ❗

👉 Important rule:

```id="t4p8x2"
VPC A ↔ VPC B
VPC B ↔ VPC C

A cannot talk to C ❌
```

---

## 🔹 No overlapping CIDR

Example:

```id="m2n7k9"
VPC A: 10.0.0.0/16
VPC B: 10.0.0.0/16 ❌
```

---

---

## 🔹 Traffic is private

* No internet exposure

